ISO-10303-21;
/* P003: PRODUCT / NAUO name fields contain \X\ single-byte escape sequences encoding control characters (SOH=\X\01, BS=\X\08, US=\X\1F) that are illegal in XML serialization; STEP import succeeds silently but downstream save-and-reopen of the receiving document fails to parse the serialized XML; kernel must sanitize/escape names at parse time or reject with warning; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
